# worker-configuration.d.ts IS committed. DIRECTIVE.md §11 requires generated non-secret binding
# types in source control so that a clean clone typechecks without Cloudflare credentials, and
# AGENTS.md §3.1 bans hand-writing Env. It contains binding NAMES only, never values.
# Owner: platform-release-sre (docs/agents/ROSTER.md §3). Regenerate with `wrangler types`.

